<title>USA: First of America Bank Corp Q4 net up.</title>
<headline>First of America Bank Corp Q4 net up.</headline>
<dateline>KALAMAZOO, Mich. 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.38		    $1.04</p>
<p> Net			 83,971		   66,019</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  59,813		   63,284</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q4 1996 results include $14.3 million in gains from branch sales and one-time charges of $4.2 million for severance and write-downs. Q4 1995 results included $9.1 million in gains from branch sales after tax. Excluding items, Q4 1996 oper earnings $1.22 a share, up from $0.90 a year ago.  </p>
<p>Assets $22.06 billion vs $23.60 billion</p>
<p>Deposits $17.62 billion vs $19.34 billion.</p>
<p>Loans $15.06 billion vs $16.08 billion.</p>
<p>			YEAR</p>
<p> Shr			  $4.16		    $3.73</p>
<p> Net			256,886		  236,708</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  61,775		   63,501</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Excluding items, full-year 1996 earnings were $4.23 a share, up from $3.70 in 1995.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
